#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrición"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; is a program for managing various archive formats within the "
#| "&kde; environment. Archives can be viewed, extracted, created and "
#| "modified from within &kappname;. The program can handle various formats "
#| "such as <application>tar</application>, <application>gzip</application>, "
#| "<application>bzip2</application>, <application>zip</application>, "
#| "<application>rar</application> and <application>lha</application> (if "
#| "appropriate command-line programs are installed). &kappname; can work "
#| "closely with &konqueror; in the &kde; environment to handle archives, if "
#| "you install the &konqueror; Integration plugin available in the kdeaddons "
#| "package."
msgid ""
"&ark; is a program for managing various compressed file formats within "
"&kde;. Archives can be viewed, extracted, created and modified with &ark;. "
"The program can handle various formats such as <application>tar</"
"application>, <application>gzip</application>, <application>bzip2</"
"application>, <application>zip</application>, <application>rar</application> "
"(when the appropriate libraries or command-line programs are installed)."
msgstr ""
"O &ark; é un programa para xestionar diversos formatos de arquivos no "
"&kde;. Pódense ver, extraer, crear e modificar os arquivos co &ark;. O "
"programa pode tratar diversos formatos, como o "
"<application>tar</application>, o <application>gzip</application>, o "
"<application>bzip2</application>, o <application>zip</application> e o "
"<application>rar</application> (se "
"estiveren instalados as bibliotecas e os programas da liña de ordes "
"apropiados)."

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
#| msgid "Options"
msgid "Operation modes"
msgstr "Modos de funcionamento"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ark; can be used either as a stand-alone &GUI; program as well as a command-"
"line program in order to perform some specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"O &ark; pódese empregar tanto como programa con &GUI; autónomo como como "
"programa da liña de ordes para realizar determinadas tarefas específicas."

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If invoked without the -b (--batch) or -c (--add) options, &ark; is started "
"as a normal &GUI; program."
msgstr ""
"Se se invoca sen as opcións  -b (--batch) ou -c (--add), o &ark; iníciase "
"como un programa normal con &GUI;."

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the -b (--batch) option is used, &ark; can be used to extract the "
"contents of one or more files directly from the command-line, without "
"launching its &GUI;."
msgstr ""
"Cando se emprega a opción -b (--batch), o &ark; pódese empregar para extraer "
"o contido de un ou máis ficheiros directamente desde a liña de ordes, sen "
"iniciar a súa &GUI;."

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the -c (--add) option is used, &ark; prompts for files that should be "
"added to a new archive or to an existing archive."
msgstr ""
"Cando se emprega a opción -c (--add), o &ark; pide os ficheiros que se desexa "
"engadir a un arquivo novo ou a un xa existente."

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcións"

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "-d, --dialog"
msgstr "-d, --dialog"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show a dialog for specifying the options for a batch or add operation."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar un diálogo para indicar as opcións dunha operación de lote ou de "
"engadido."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
#| msgid "--add <replaceable>files</replaceable>"
msgid "-o, --destination <replaceable>directory</replaceable>"
msgstr "-o, --destination <replaceable>directorio</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Default the extraction directory to <replaceable>directory</replaceable>. If "
"not passed, the current path is used."
msgstr ""
"Directorio de extracción por omisión en <replaceable>directorio</replaceable>"
". Se non se pasa, emprégase a ruta actual."

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options for adding files"
msgstr "Opcións para engadir ficheiros"

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "-c, --add"
msgstr "-c, --add"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Ask for the name of the archive to add <replaceable>files</replaceable> "
#| "to. Quit when finished."
msgid ""
"Query the user for an archive filename and add specified files to it. Quit "
"when finished."
msgstr ""
"Preguntarlle ao usuario o nome do arquivo e engadirlle os ficheiros "
"indicados. Saír ao rematar."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
#| msgid "--add <replaceable>files</replaceable>"
msgid "-t, --add-to <replaceable>filename</replaceable>"
msgstr "-t, --add-to <replaceable>nome de ficheiro</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Ask for the name of the archive to add <replaceable>files</replaceable> "
#| "to. Quit when finished."
msgid ""
"Add the specified files to <replaceable>filename</replaceable>. Create "
"archive if it does not exist. Quit when finished."
msgstr ""
"Engadir os ficheiros especificados a <replaceable>nome de ficheiro<"
"/replaceable>. Crear o arquivo se non existe. Saír tras rematar."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "-p, --changetofirstpath"
msgstr "-p, --changetofirstpath"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Change the current directory to the first entry and add all other entries "
"relative to this one."
msgstr ""
"Mudar o directorio actual para a primeira entrada e engadir todas as outras "
"entradas relativas a esta."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
#| msgid "--add <replaceable>files</replaceable>"
msgid "-f, --autofilename <replaceable>suffix</replaceable>"
msgstr "-f, --autofilename <replaceable>sufixo</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Automatically choose a filename, with the selected <replaceable>suffix</"
"replaceable> (for example rar, tar.gz, zip or any other supported types)."
msgstr ""
"Escoller automaticamente un nome de ficheiro, co <replaceable>sufixo<"
"/replaceable> escollido (por exemplo rar, tar.gz, zip ou calquera outro tipo "
"admitido)."

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options for batch extraction"
msgstr "Opcións para a extracción en lote"

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "b, --batch"
msgstr "b, --batch"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the batch interface instead of the usual dialog. This option is implied "
"if more than one url is specified."
msgstr ""
"Empregar a interface de lotes no canto do diálogo habitual. Esta opción é "
"implícita de especificárense máis de un URL."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "-e, --autodestination"
msgstr "-e, --autodestination"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The destination argument will be set to the path of the first file supplied."
msgstr ""
"O argumento de destino establécese como a ruta do primeiro ficheiro que se "
"indique."

#. Tag: option
#: man-ark.1.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "-a, --autosubfolder"
msgstr "-a, --autosubfolder"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Archive contents will be read, and if detected to not be a single folder "
"archive, a subfolder by the name of the archive will be created."
msgstr ""
"O contido do arquivo lese e, se se detectar que non se trata dun arquivo cun "
"único cartafol, créase un subcartafol co nome do arquivo."

#. Tag: title
#: man-ark.1.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Exemplos"

#. Tag: userinput
#: man-ark.1.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>ark</command> <option>--add-to</option> <filename>*.jpg</"
#| "filename> <filename>pictures.tar.bz2</filename>"
msgid ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--batch</option> <replaceable>archive.tar."
"bz2</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--batch</option> <replaceable>arquivo.tar."
"bz2</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Will extract <replaceable>archive.tar.bz2</replaceable> into the current "
"directory without showing any &GUI;."
msgstr ""
"Extrae <replaceable>arquivo.tar.bz2</replaceable> no directorio actual sen "
"mostrar unha interface gráfica."

#. Tag: userinput
#: man-ark.1.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "--add-to <replaceable>files</replaceable> <replaceable>archive</"
#| "replaceable>"
msgid ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>-b</option> <option>-d</option> "
"<replaceable>archive.tar.bz2</replaceable> <replaceable>archive2.zip</"
"replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>-b</option> <option>-d</option> "
"<replaceable>arquivo.tar.bz2</replaceable> <replaceable>arquivo2.zip</"
"replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Will first show an extraction options dialog and then extract both "
"<replaceable>archive.tar.bz2</replaceable> and <replaceable>archive2.zip</"
"replaceable> into the directory chosen in the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Mostra primeiro un diálogo con opcións de extracción e a seguir extrae "
"<replaceable>arquivo.tar.bz2</replaceable> e <replaceable>arquivo2.zip</"
"replaceable> no directorio escollido no diálogo."

#. Tag: userinput
#: man-ark.1.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>ark</command> <option>--add-to</option> <filename>*.jpg</"
#| "filename> <filename>pictures.tar.bz2</filename>"
msgid ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--add-to</option> <replaceable>my-archive."
"zip</replaceable> <replaceable>photo1.jpg</replaceable> <replaceable>text."
"txt</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"<command>ark</command> <option>--add-to</option> <replaceable>o_meu_arquivo."
"zip</replaceable> <replaceable>foto1.jpg</replaceable> <replaceable>texto."
"txt</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-ark.1.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Extract <replaceable>archive</replaceable> to <replaceable>folder</"
#| "replaceable>. Quit when finished. <replaceable>folder</replaceable> will "
#| "be created if it does not exist."
msgid ""
"Will create <replaceable>my-archive.zip</replaceable> if does not exist and "
"then add <replaceable>photo1.jpg</replaceable> and <replaceable>text.txt</"
"replaceable> to it."
msgstr ""
"Crea <replaceable>o_meu_arquivo.zip</replaceable> se este non existe e a "
"seguir engádelle <replaceable>foto1.jpg</replaceable> e <replaceable>"
"texto.txt</"
"replaceable>."

